cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this companion, please cite it as below, together with the
  book it accompanies.
type: software
title: "Computational Systems Biology in MATLAB and Python: a code companion"
abstract: >-
  An open code companion to the book "An Introduction to Computational
  Systems Biology: Systems-Level Modelling of Cellular Networks" (Karthik
  Raman, CRC Press, 2021). Its chapters and sections follow the book's, and
  every worked example is given in both MATLAB and Python, with results
  that are checked against each other and against the book on every change.
authors:
  - family-names: Raman
    given-names: Karthik
    affiliation: Indian Institute of Technology Madras
repository-code: "https://github.com/RamanLab/sysbio-code-companion"
url: "https://ramanlab.github.io/sysbio-code-companion"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - systems biology
  - computational biology
  - network biology
  - constraint-based modelling
  - dynamic modelling
  - MATLAB
  - Python
  - teaching
